90CCAF72580781DC000004CB21045B04,0,피치 성으로 순간 이동하시겠습니까?
C3C0648359EA01D70000FEDAF4D025B7,0,"/-{0}% <font preset=""Preset Card Ubi Game Text Regular"">무기</font>/-{1}% <font preset=""Preset Card Ubi Game Text Regular"">이동</font>"
